OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA mostly dull and cloudy
OL,6,Fmorning with persistent rain, heavy at
OL,7,Ftimes. Drier and brighter at times
OL,8,Facross western parts of the Moray
OL,9,Fcoast. Rain gradually clearing north
OL,10,Fin the afternoon with some brighter
OL,11,Fintervals developing later.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA mostly cloudy evening,
OL,14,Flargely dry with just the odd spot of
OL,15,Frain around the coast. Similar
OL,16,Fovernight with perhaps a few clearer
OL,17,Fspells in the west. Rather cold.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
