OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FA dry day with bright or
OL,6,Fsunny spells. Sunny spells will become
OL,7,Fincreasingly long with mostly clear
OL,8,Fskies by the end of the afternoon.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FCloudy
OL,11,Fand breezy with heavy rain clearing to
OL,12,Fthe north later on Friday. Further
OL,13,Fspells of heavy rain over the weekend
OL,14,Fwith winds strengthening and bringing
OL,15,Fa risk of gales.
